{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"Jigsaw runs back into the safety of their ship and shuts the door. They walk over to their desk and pick up a piece of paper they'd been sketching on to look it over for the thousandth time. \"Maybe... I still need supplies but-\" they scratch at their chin. \"Tomorrow. I should at least ask...\" They quickly move their hand from their chin to itch at their arm \"and I should really ask around about this dang itching\" they grit their teeth. Their tail begins to bristle but they sigh and rub their eyes. \"Sleep... Sleep will do me some good.\" They curl up into their bed and try sleeping next to their armor rather than in it... But wake up halfway through their rest  and climb sleepily into it grumbling about \"dirty coats come attack the ship\".","created_at":"2021-07-20T06:36:58.579000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866931676876505108","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
