{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"To: jigsaw\nfrom: eclipse engineers union.\n||Jigsaw,\nwe've been impressed by your works and are saddened to hear that the royal soldiers of england have confiscated your work. we're trying our best to file for it's release but the crown has made a lot of property commandeering cases difficult to manage. your work is far too valuable and we have little faith they'd even know what to do with it.\n\nonce again, thank you for braving the new world as our emmisary,\nveronica chapelle, on behalf of eclipse engineering union||","created_at":"2021-07-23T23:40:08.423000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868276328141570098","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
