{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"They open a compartment in their desk and take stock of the essence they've gathered thus far. They decide it's about time they use it for something, they're just not sure what yet. They turn back to their armor and carefully finish one of the runes (artificer infusion, +1 to AC), before jumping at the sound of thunder.","created_at":"2021-07-25T19:50:45.903000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868943379680075866","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"Their tail bristles as they look around them before peeking their head out of the door to look around.","created_at":"2021-07-25T19:51:09.087000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868943476920819722","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"\"*Hello Jigsaw.*\" a sinister voice enunciates from the right.","created_at":"2021-07-25T19:51:55.839000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868943673012928533","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"Their antenna prick up as they turn to their right. \"Who is this?\" They say snippily.","created_at":"2021-07-25T19:52:54.731000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868943920023875634","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"Malathor, a Tiefling clad in dark red and black robes trimmed with silver steps from the shadows, in one hand he holds a scepter topped with a crystal sphere filed with swirling shadows clutched in a Dragon claw made of gold, in the other he holds... A letter sealed with wax. \"I am Malathor. We may have met before, but were not properly introduced. You know an associate of mine, he lives in the sewers...\" The Tiefling goes on to explain.","created_at":"2021-07-25T19:56:53.749000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868944922538016828","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"Jigsaw tilts their head and looks him up and down and pauses before answering. They instinctually situate themselves to stand a bit taller in his presence. \"Ah, I see, you must be Bo's master... Master of what exactly I'm curious to find out.\" They snicker slightly under their breath.","created_at":"2021-07-25T20:03:29.434000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868946582161215550","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"\"Curious you say... Mmm yes, curiosity. That is an important quality, in an *inventor* such as yourself...\" Malathor says as he shifts his footing. \"Though, after today, I am Bo's master no longer...\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T20:12:59.014000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868948971152900138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"\"May I perhaps... Come in?\" He asks hopefully.","created_at":"2021-07-25T20:14:57.722000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868949469050339419","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"(Gonna get some lunch back in a bit)","created_at":"2021-07-25T20:15:14.298000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868949538575114262","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"\"Yes... But I just talked to Bo last night, did he do something to upset you?\" They pause and look Malathor up and down again and consider letting them inside. \"Sure, one moment.\" They shut the door quickly behind them, return to their desk and stuff all their essence into the compartments in their armor, along with their blueprints and designs. They open the door and nod \"No offense, but you have many shiny things, and I don't know how you got them. Protecting my work is my top priority. Better safe than sorry.\" They open the door wider to allow him into the cluttered mess of the Vexed Mastermind. Even with their work mostly hidden away, there are still scraps of metal piled around, and the low hanging pipes make it obvious the ship is more suitable for someone of Jigsaw's size.","created_at":"2021-07-25T20:24:46.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868951939281461319","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"It's also obvious that Jigsaw doesn't have visitors often... Or ever. There are only two places to sit, their bed or the desk chair across the room.","created_at":"2021-07-25T20:26:20.683000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868952333596385280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
