{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"Malathor nods graciously \"Yes... It is wise to be *cautious*...\" He enters paying no mind to the clutter left by an active inventor and has a seat in the deskchair, leaning his scepter against the wall. \"So Jigsaw... Are you familiar with the one they call Wintergreen?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T21:12:17.495000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868963896503971860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"They walk to their bed, but lean against it rather than sitting. \"I don't think I've talked to them. It's possible we've fought together but I'm not sure.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T21:22:23.415000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868966437916643328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"Malathor nods. \"They are an inventor, like yourself... I have, *hired* him to help me with a *special* project of mine... I have in my possesion, *blueprints* for a machine, designs that were worked on by names such as Perşu, and Da Vinci... one that may change the course of this war... And I want you to help me build it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T21:31:08.201000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868968639028666438","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"They cratch their chin in thought. \"As an inventor, I work with information, so I'm going to need some more if I'm going to assign my talents to someone else's work. This machine, what exactly does it do?\" They swish their tail and add pointedly, \"You also never answered my question about Bo.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T21:39:41.284000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868970791054741504","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"\"Ah yes, *Bo*... Not at all, infact, No has performed *well beyond my expectations*... At this time he is... Contemplating what to do now that he has ascended. In terms of information, I require an oath from you that should I bring you into this project, you will *not* tell another living soul about these designs, For if they were to fall into... *the wrong hands...* The results could be *unfortunate.*\" Malathor explains in a hushed tone. \n*He reaches into his sleeve...* and pulls out an apple.","created_at":"2021-07-25T21:44:19.969000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868971959944372335","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
